{"version":"1.0","createSurface":{"surfaceId":"webhooks_1","catalogId":"https://a2ui.org/specification/v1_0/catalogs/basic/catalog.json","sendDataModel":true,"components":[{"id":"root","component":"Column","children":["intro_card","setup_card","actions"]},{"id":"intro_card","component":"Card","child":"intro"},{"id":"intro","component":"Markdown","text":"## Webhooks for Lumen Pay\nWebhooks tell your server about events **as they happen**, so you do not poll the API.\n\n1. Pick the environment and the events below.\n2. We create the endpoint and give you a signing secret.\n3. Verify each request's `Lumen-Signature` header before you trust it.\n\nSee the [webhook reference](https://docs.example.com/webhooks) for every event type.","@catalogId":"https://github.com/AIDotNet/TKCode.Arc/a2ui/catalogs/arc/v1"},{"id":"setup_card","component":"Card","child":"setup"}],"dataModel":{"env":"test","events":{"payment":true,"refund":true,"dispute":false},"stars":0}}}
